{
  "document_id": "legacy/story/cac6c4f06aba/ch03",
  "extensions": {
    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 3,
      "location": "前往以醫術聞名的賽拉村(祭司醫療法術神奇,能治悠妮失憶)。途中救下被追殺的鐵諾。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_003",
      "title": "第三章 — 賽拉村途中,鐵諾與葛雷的秘密"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": null
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "過了這座橋,就快到以醫術聞名的賽拉村了。這村子中的祭司醫療法術非常神奇,應該能治好悠妮的失憶症。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "希望如此..咦.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "speaker_name": "鐵諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-2",
          "text": "..呼,這回大概是追不上了...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 7,
              "speaker_name": "約"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-7",
          "text": "鐵諾,總算追上你了吧!這下子看你怎麼逃!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "speaker_name": "鐵諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-2",
          "text": "你們到底和我有什麼仇恨,非得要殺死我不可?!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 7,
              "speaker_name": "約"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-7",
          "text": "若你能活到我們隊長趕到的時候,你再自己去問他吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "speaker_name": "鐵諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-2",
          "text": "可惡!我和你們拼了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "唉呀!看,橋上有人準備要打架耶!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "以多打少,這太不公平了!走,亞雷斯,我們去幫那個落單的人!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "索爾,我們還沒搞清楚這是怎麼一回事,這太..!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "看那些士兵蠻不講理的樣子,就知道他一定是好人!亞雷斯,你到底去不去?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "去,去!我總不能看著你一個人去拼命,認識你算我倒楣!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "我也去!我也去!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "既然如此,那麼大家都去吧!走囉!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 77,
              "speaker_name": "約"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-77",
          "text": "鐵諾,你果然很耐命!怪不得頭子一定要我親自來看看....不過,你的好運也到此為止了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "speaker_name": "鐵諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-2",
          "text": "如果不是這些年輕人幫忙的話,我早就沒命了!不過既然我還活著,我還是要問你一個問題:到底是誰命令你來殺我?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 77,
              "speaker_name": "約"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-77",
          "text": "告訴你也不要緊,是葛雷大人命令我們來除掉你的!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/17",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "葛雷?那個心胸狹窄的禁衛軍統領?是為了三年前爭奪卡蘿那女孩的事吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "speaker_name": "鐵諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/18",
          "speaker": "character/native-2",
          "text": "妳..妳怎麼會知道這件事?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/19",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "秘密!不過你可以放心,我們都會幫你的。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 77,
              "speaker_name": "約"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0/lines/20",
          "speaker": "character/native-77",
          "text": "可惡!幫他的都得死,何況你們已經知道了這個秘密,那就別怪我不留情!給我殺!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "戰後"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 77,
              "speaker_name": "約"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-77",
          "text": "我竟然會敗在一批小鬼的手下....葛雷大人....!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "真遺憾,我們已經盡力了,結果還是幫不了他...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "也好,讓他到地下和愛人相聚,也不用再四處躲避別人的追殺...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "希莉亞,妳的真實身份究竟是什麼?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "秘密!總之,我們安葬他之後就趕快離開這裡吧,要不然的話,麻煩可能還在後頭呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "就這麼辦吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "speaker_name": "鐵諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-2",
          "text": "多謝各位的幫助,我才能逃過這次追殺。不過葛雷是不會就此罷手的,我在這片土地上,還是找不到安居之所...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "那你可以加入我們啊!像你這樣老練的戰士,對我們來說是不可多得的伙伴,而我們一群人在一起,我保證葛雷不敢隨便對你下手。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "speaker_name": "鐵諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-2",
          "text": "小姐,妳為什麼會知道這些事,我.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "秘密!反正你加入我們就是了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "哼!一副故作神秘的樣子,真是個古靈精怪的丫頭。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 8,
              "speaker_name": "希莉亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-8",
          "text": "你說什麼?我可是在為你們增加有力的伙伴呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "不希罕!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 2,
              "speaker_name": "鐵諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-2",
          "text": "我已經決定了,如果各位不嫌棄我的話,以後就請多多關照。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "歡迎!不過,我們還是趕快離開此地,剩下的事以後再說了!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "說得對,我們上路吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這....這是什麼碗糕!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 6,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1/lines/17",
          "speaker": "character/native-6",
          "text": "卡蘿娜.....!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/cac6c4f06aba/scenes/1"
    }
  ],
